WEBVTT

00:10:29.917 --> 00:10:32.878
(Laughter)

00:10:32.878 --> 00:10:37.299
Hot damn, y'all, people
loved ladies' sports, right?

00:10:37.299 --> 00:10:38.634
(Laughter)

00:10:38.676 --> 00:10:39.843
I mean ...

00:10:39.885 --> 00:10:42.012
(Applause)

00:10:42.012 --> 00:10:43.180
Who knew?

00:10:43.722 --> 00:10:47.226
Well, wherever you find
compelling storylines

00:10:47.226 --> 00:10:49.311
and agreed-upon stakes,

00:10:49.353 --> 00:10:52.606
you will find people
on the edge of their seat.

00:10:53.273 --> 00:10:56.360
No matter the vertical leap
of the participant.

00:10:57.778 --> 00:10:58.904
So ...

00:10:59.571 --> 00:11:03.117
Who tells the storylines
of women’s sports today?